# The second act's opening, from the telephone to the Amber vision.
#
# The three counts testForPsionicWaves needs are set directly rather than
# replayed, since hints.walk already covers earning them; what this exercises
# is the chain from the ringing phone to the vision being on, which is what
# lets the ghosts call and opens the portals.
give Oscillator
use Oscillator
StudyAmberCU
click 315 190
state oscillatorinplace
set psionicWavesPresent 1
set ghostlyPhoneCall ringingNow
# Answer the telephone. The handset and its buttons are their own hotspots,
# so hanging up means clicking the room around them.
LivingRmPhoneCU
click 320 250
state ghostlyphonecall
click 100 300
state ambervision
# Approach the AMBER device: activated, ready, raised, and put on.
StudyAmberMid
click 320 220
click 300 200
click 300 200
state playerhasheadgear
# Stow the headgear and step back, and the vision comes on.
click 600 100
click 600 100
state ambervision
# With the vision on, the 1940s bedroom shows a way through that is not there
# without it. Three walls offer it; this is the east one.
MargEwall
click 180 220
# Through the portal, and into Margaret's chapter.
click 322 242
state currentdomain
